{
  "info": {
    "name": "Technician Mobile API (v1)",
    "description": "# Technician Mobile API\n\nSource: `routes/api.php` under `/api/v1/technician`.\n\n## Flow\n1. Login (or demo-login for store review)\n2. Register FCM device + subscribe to `private-technician.{id}`\n3. Orders appear only after customer pays inspection fee\n4. Queue: each order gets `queue_position`, per-order `estimated_duration_minutes`, and `scheduled_at` (ETA). List sorted by queue_position. Show Accept when `can_accept=true` (`assigned` → `accepted`). Cancel/reject blocked while is_accepting_orders=true.\n4b. PATCH /job-preferences sets defaults only (`is_accepting_orders` + `estimated_job_duration_minutes`); do NOT use the global duration as the order display — use order.scheduled_at + order.estimated_duration_minutes.\n4c. Order payload helpers: `status_group` (waiting|on_way|in_progress|completed|cancelled), `allowed_next_statuses`, `can_accept` / `can_start_trip` / `can_mark_arrived` / `can_complete` / `can_cancel`, `customer`, `pending_offer_id`.\n5. `accepted` → `technician_on_way` → `arrived` (drive UI from allowed_next_statuses)\n6. Add price-list items + optional extra_amount → `POST .../request-payment`\n7. Wait for customer accept-invoice + pay → status becomes `started`\n8. `PATCH` status `completed` when work is done\n9. Optional on status PATCH: `estimated_duration_minutes` to set this order's duration and refresh queue ETAs\n\n## Auth\nSanctum Bearer. Login returns `{ token, token_type, user, technician }`.\nDemo: `POST /technician/demo-login` (when `TECHNICIAN_DEMO_LOGIN_ENABLED=true`).\nSeed: `technician-demo@example.test` / `password`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost"
    },
    {
      "key": "locale",
      "value": "ar"
    },
    {
      "key": "technician_email",
      "value": "technician-demo@example.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "technician_password",
      "value": "password"
    },
    {
      "key": "technician_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "technician_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "offer_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "item_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "device_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "company_price_item_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('technician_token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.technician && j.technician.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('technician_id', String(j.technician.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{technician_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{technician_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/login",
            "description": "Real technician account (created from company dashboard)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Demo login (store review)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('technician_token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.technician && j.technician.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('technician_id', String(j.technician.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/demo-login",
            "description": "No body. Uses TECHNICIAN_DEMO_EMAIL/PASSWORD. Returns 404 when disabled."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/logout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Presence & Devices",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Update availability",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"availability_status\": \"available\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/availability"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update job preferences",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"is_accepting_orders\": true,\n  \"estimated_job_duration_minutes\": 90\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/job-preferences",
            "description": "Toggle receiving orders and/or personal estimated job duration (minutes). Personal duration overrides company default_job_duration_minutes for queue wait estimates. While is_accepting_orders=true, technician cannot cancel assigned orders (mandatory accept)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update location",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"lat\": 29.375859,\n  \"lng\": 47.977405\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/location"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register device",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_type\": \"android\",\n  \"fcm_token\": \"demo-fcm-token\",\n  \"device_name\": \"Postman\",\n  \"app_version\": \"1.0.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/devices"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete device",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/devices/{{device_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Broadcasting auth",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"socket_id\": \"1234.5678\",\n  \"channel_name\": \"private-technician.{{technician_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/broadcasting/auth",
            "description": "Subscribe to private-technician.{id}. Events: order.awaiting-accept, order.status-changed, offer.created"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Offers",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List order offers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/order-offers"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept offer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/order-offers/{{offer_id}}/accept"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject offer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"response_note\": \"Busy\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/order-offers/{{offer_id}}/reject"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List orders (paid inspection only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "  if (data[0]) pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', String(data[0].id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders",
            "description": "Work queue. Hidden until inspection paid. Includes customer, status_group, can_accept, allowed_next_statuses, scheduled_at, estimated_duration_minutes."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}",
            "description": "Full detail: customer (+user name/phone), customer_address, service_problem, items, payments, status_histories, intake_answers, action flags."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept assigned order (status=accepted)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"accepted\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 90\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/status",
            "description": "Accept when can_accept=true. Optional estimated_duration_minutes sets per-order duration and recalculates scheduled_at for the queue."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "On the way",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"technician_on_way\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Arrived",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"arrived\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete work (after customer paid → started)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"completed\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/status",
            "description": "Only from started after final invoice paid."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Price list & quote",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "My company price list",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const items = j.data || j.price_items || [];",
                  "  if (items[0] && items[0].id) pm.collectionVariables.set('company_price_item_id', String(items[0].id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/price-list?q="
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add item from price list",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"company_price_item_id\": {{company_price_item_id}},\n  \"name_ar\": \"خدمة\",\n  \"name_en\": \"Service\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"unit_price\": 10.000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/items",
            "description": "Only while status=arrived (or waiting_customer_payment before customer accepts)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request payment (send invoice + optional extra)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"extra_amount\": 2.500,\n  \"extra_name_ar\": \"مبلغ إضافي\",\n  \"extra_name_en\": \"Extra amount\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/request-payment",
            "description": "Moves order to waiting_customer_payment and notifies customer. Work starts only after customer accept-invoice + pay."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update item",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2,\n  \"unit_price\": 10.000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/items/{{item_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{technician_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/technician/orders/{{order_id}}/items/{{item_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
